    "noticeMsg": "<section class=\"\" style=\"background-color: #fff4e1; margin-bottom: unset;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"overflow: hidden; background-color: #fcf0dc; margin-bottom: unset;\" data-support=\"96编辑器\">\n<section style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"overflow: hidden; background-color: #fff4e1; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #de8577; font-size: 33px; line-height: 1; margin: 25px 0px unset 0px;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\"><span style=\"color: #7b0600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: red;\">延时开放公告</span></strong></section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section style=\"overflow: hidden; background-color: #fcf0dc; margin-bottom: unset;\" data-tpl-id=\"25463\">\n<section style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\" data-tpl-id=\"22190\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"overflow: hidden; background-color: #fff4e1; margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"margin: 15px 0 15px;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"margin-bottom: unset;\">\n<section class=\"\" style=\"color: #790000; font-size: 15px; margin: 13px;\">\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.034em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><strong>亲爱的游客朋友们：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">2026年中秋、国庆假期将至，为更好满足广大观众假日期间精神文化需求，进一步提升博物院接待服务能力，汉景帝阳陵博物院将实行延时开放，具体时间安排如下：</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\"><strong>一、延时公告</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;1. 此次双节延时惠民开放时间为：2026年9月25日至9月27日；10月1日至7日，共10天。</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: #00000000; font-size: 14px;\">博物院开放时间增加90分钟。即：08:30开始检票，</span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: #00000000; font-size: 14px; color: #ab1942;\"><strong>18:30停止进入（原17:00停止进入）</strong></span><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: #00000000; font-size: 14px;\">。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\"><strong>二、门票价格</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;1.成人票：</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;旺季 (3月至11月)：70元/人</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;2.学生票：</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;旺季 (3月至11月)：35元/人</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"overflow: hidden; background-color: #fff4e1; text-align: left; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">政策性免票按照国家有关规定执行</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\"><strong>三、购票方式</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">1. 实名制窗口购票；</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\">2. 游客可以在&ldquo;汉景帝阳陵博物院&rdquo;和&ldquo;汉阳陵国家考古遗址公园&rdquo;微信公众号，携程、美团等OTA平台进行实名预约购票；</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-align: left;\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #000000;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;background-color:rgb(255, 244, 225);margin-bottom:unset;&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-tpl-id&quot;:&quot;25463&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;overflow:hidden;background-color:rgb(252, 240, 220);margin-bottom:unset;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin-bottom:unset;&quot;},&quot;